---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: invest(amount, signature)
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale already ended
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid from Legion signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: InvalidSignature
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: below minimum
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: bidToken.transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> q_emit: totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Investment(investor, amount)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-001: deposits represent maximum allocation commitments
        INV-002: actual allocation determined by project during application processing
        INV-003: investors may deposit multiple times before sale conclusion
    end note
